    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NightGard \u2013 The Night Keeper, Alone in a Cursed School...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude96 <strong>A trip to a small village for a simple job... turns into an unavoidable nightmare.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins inside a <strong>taxi</strong>, as the protagonist arrives at an isolated village to work as a <strong>night guard at an old school located on the edge of the forest</strong>. However, warnings from a stranger about a <strong>mysterious danger that roams at night</strong> are quickly brushed off... until <strong>the real horror begins</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd26 Explore, Escape, and Break the Curse!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f <strong>A School Drenched in Darkness</strong> \u2013 A detailed environment full of hidden secrets.<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>A Relentless Enemy</strong> \u2013 A mysterious man wearing a <strong>goat skull mask</strong>, relentlessly hunting you down.<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Mysterious Puzzles</strong> \u2013 A magical book, ancient rituals, and a curse that holds the key to survival.<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Chase and Stealth System</strong> \u2013 Use the environment around you to escape and hide from the deadly threat.<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>An Unexpected Ending</strong> \u2013 Will you succeed in <strong>breaking the curse</strong>, or will your fate be the same as those before you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd5b When the clock strikes 2 AM... the nightmare begins!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NightGard</strong> takes you on a psychological horror journey with unexpected twists where <strong>fear is real</strong>, and <strong>escape is your only option</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Do you have the courage to enter the school?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NightGard \u2013 The Night Keeper, Alone in a Cursed School...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude96 <strong>A trip to a small village for a simple job... turns into an unavoidable nightmare.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins inside a <strong>taxi</strong>, as the protagonist arrives at an isolated village to work as a <strong>night guard at an old school located on the edge of the forest</strong>. However, warnings from a stranger about a <strong>mysterious danger that roams at night</strong> are quickly brushed off... until <strong>the real horror begins</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd26 Explore, Escape, and Break the Curse!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f <strong>A School Drenched in Darkness</strong> \u2013 A detailed environment full of hidden secrets.<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>A Relentless Enemy</strong> \u2013 A mysterious man wearing a <strong>goat skull mask</strong>, relentlessly hunting you down.<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Mysterious Puzzles</strong> \u2013 A magical book, ancient rituals, and a curse that holds the key to survival.<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Chase and Stealth System</strong> \u2013 Use the environment around you to escape and hide from the deadly threat.<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>An Unexpected Ending</strong> \u2013 Will you succeed in <strong>breaking the curse</strong>, or will your fate be the same as those before you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd5b When the clock strikes 2 AM... the nightmare begins!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NightGard</strong> takes you on a psychological horror journey with unexpected twists where <strong>fear is real</strong>, and <strong>escape is your only option</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Do you have the courage to enter the school?</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "In NightGard, you\u2019re a night guard in a cursed school, where a deadly entity with a goat skull mask hunts after 2 AM. Uncover dark secrets, solve mystical puzzles, and escape the nightmare before it\u2019s too late. Survival is your only chance.",
